1) Hotel within 20 km of the airport
- Villa Fiorita
  - Location: Monastier di Treviso (near Treviso), about 18–19 km from Venice Marco Polo Airport by road.
  - Distance to airport: roughly 18–20 km (approximate driving time 25–35 minutes depending on traffic).
  - Price for 3 nights: around 266–292 EUR total (all taxes/charges shown in the listing; USD equivalents shown in the data around US$260–290 total). If you prefer a breakdown, the listing indicates about US$96 per night with taxes, or €266 total for the stay.
  - Room type: 1 hotel room (1 double bed or 2 singles).
